{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a sticky announcement bar at the top of the site with a built-in countdown timer.
    
    Functionality
    
    The bar must be fixed at the top of the page (always visible while scrolling).
    
    Full-width, above all content.
    
    Add a setting to define the end date and time for the countdown.
    
    Display the remaining time in Days : Hours : Minutes : Seconds.
    
    Update the timer every second.
    
    When the countdown reaches zero, either:
    
    replace the timer with a custom message (e.g. “Le Marché has ended”), or
    
    hide the bar (make this behavior configurable).
    
    Content
    
    Text field for a short message (e.g. “Last days of Le Marché – up to 70% off”).
    
    Option to include an optional CTA link/button inside the bar.
    
    Design & settings
    
    Background color picker.
    
    Text color picker.
    
    Font picker + font size (px) for the message and numbers.
    
    Spacing controls for padding (top/bottom).
    
    Option to center or left-align the content.
    
    Optional close “X” button that hides the bar and remembers dismissal for the session.
    
    Responsive
    
    Must work perfectly on mobile and desktop, without overlapping the header content.
    
    Keep the style minimal and elegant., Please update the sticky announcement bar with countdown to improve the mobile layout.
    
    Issue:
    On mobile, the message and the countdown are breaking into two stacked lines and the bar looks too tall.
    
    Required fixes (mobile only):
    
    Single-line layout
    
    On mobile screens, display the message text and the countdown timer on a single horizontal row, inside one compact bar.
    
    Reduce font sizes and spacing so both elements fit on one line.
    
    Compact style
    
    Decrease vertical padding on mobile so the bar height is smaller.
    
    Use abbreviated labels for the timer (e.g. “D”, “H”, “M”, “S”) or hide labels if needed to keep everything on one line.
    
    Desktop behavior
    
    Keep the current desktop layout exactly as it is.
    
    Only change the layout and spacing for mobile.
    
    Do not change the text, colors, close button, or countdown logic — only adjust the mobile layout to a single, slim line., EMOVE LABELS (D, H, M, S) FROM COUNTDOWN BAR, Please update the sticky countdown announcement bar with the following change:
    
    1. Remove the “days” unit entirely
    
    Do not display the days field.
    
    The countdown must show only:
    Hours : Minutes : Seconds
    Example: 12 : 00 : 55
    
    2. Auto-adjust logic
    
    If the remaining time is more than 24 hours, convert the extra days into hours so the timer still counts down correctly.
    
    The countdown should smoothly continue using the larger total hours.
    
    3. Layout
    
    Re-center the timer so it aligns visually with the message on the same row.
    
    Ensure spacing between message and countdown remains balanced.
    
    4. Do not change anything else
    
    Keep fonts, background, close button, and update interval as they are., 1. Font control
    
    Add a font picker for the announcement bar so the user can select the font family.
    
    Ensure Times New Roman is available and works correctly when selected.
    
    Apply the chosen font to:
    
    the message text
    
    the countdown numbers
    
    the close (“X”) button if it contains text
    
    The font setting must override any default theme fonts.
    
    2. Keep everything else unchanged
    
    Do not alter layout, countdown logic, spacing, colors, or mobile/desktop behavior.
    
    Only add font customization and ensure Times New Roman displays properly.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    z-index: 9999;
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_vertical }}px 20px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_family.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.font_family.style }};
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hidden {
    transform: translateY(-100%);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.content_alignment }};
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.message_font_size }}px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_family.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.font_family.style }};
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-timer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-timer-unit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-timer-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.timer_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.font_family.style }};
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-separator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.timer_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    opacity: 0.6;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.font_family.style }};
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.cta_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.message_font_size }}px;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_family.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.font_family.style }};
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: 20px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 5px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .ai-announcement-bar-ended-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.message_font_size }}px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_family.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.font_family.style }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 8px 40px 8px 10px;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 11px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      flex-shrink: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-timer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 4px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-timer-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-separator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 0 -2px;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 50%;
      right: 8px;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      padding: 2px;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .ai-announcement-bar-ended-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  data-end-date="{{ block.settings.end_date }}"
  data-end-time="{{ block.settings.end_time }}"
  data-end-behavior="{{ block.settings.end_behavior }}"
  data-ended-message="{{ block.settings.ended_message }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-announcement-bar-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-announcement-bar-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {{ block.settings.message }}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-announcement-bar-timer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-timer>
      <div class="ai-announcement-bar-timer-unit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <span class="ai-announcement-bar-timer-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-hours>00</span>
      </div>
      <span class="ai-announcement-bar-separator-{{ ai_gen_id }}">:</span>
      <div class="ai-announcement-bar-timer-unit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <span class="ai-announcement-bar-timer-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-minutes>00</span>
      </div>
      <span class="ai-announcement-bar-separator-{{ ai_gen_id }}">:</span>
      <div class="ai-announcement-bar-timer-unit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <span class="ai-announcement-bar-timer-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-seconds>00</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.cta_text != blank and block.settings.cta_link != blank %}
      <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_link }}" class="ai-announcement-bar-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.cta_text }}
      </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {% if block.settings.show_close_button %}
    <button
      class="ai-announcement-bar-close-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
      aria-label="Fechar"
      data-close
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
        <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
      </svg>
    </button>
  {% endif %}
</announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class AnnouncementBar{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.endDate = this.dataset.endDate;
        this.endTime = this.dataset.endTime;
        this.endBehavior = this.dataset.endBehavior;
        this.endedMessage = this.dataset.endedMessage;
        this.timerElement = this.querySelector('[data-timer]');
        this.hoursElement = this.querySelector('[data-hours]');
        this.minutesElement = this.querySelector('[data-minutes]');
        this.secondsElement = this.querySelector('[data-seconds]');
        this.closeButton = this.querySelector('[data-close]');
        this.interval = null;
        this.storageKey = 'ai-announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}-dismissed';
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        if (sessionStorage.getItem(this.storageKey) === 'true') {
          this.classList.add('hidden');
          return;
        }

        if (this.closeButton) {
          this.closeButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.handleClose());
        }

        if (this.endDate && this.endTime) {
          this.startCountdown();
        }
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        if (this.interval) {
          clearInterval(this.interval);
        }
      }

      handleClose() {
        this.classList.add('hidden');
        sessionStorage.setItem(this.storageKey, 'true');
      }

      startCountdown() {
        const updateTimer = () => {
          const now = new Date().getTime();
          const endDateTime = new Date(this.endDate + ' ' + this.endTime).getTime();
          const distance = endDateTime - now;

          if (distance < 0) {
            clearInterval(this.interval);
            this.handleCountdownEnd();
            return;
          }

          const totalHours = Math.floor(distance / (1000 * 60 * 60));
          const minutes = Math.floor((distance % (1000 * 60 * 60)) / (1000 * 60));
          const seconds = Math.floor((distance % (1000 * 60)) / 1000);

          this.hoursElement.textContent = String(totalHours).padStart(2, '0');
          this.minutesElement.textContent = String(minutes).padStart(2, '0');
          this.secondsElement.textContent = String(seconds).padStart(2, '0');
        };

        updateTimer();
        this.interval = setInterval(updateTimer, 1000);
      }

      handleCountdownEnd() {
        if (this.endBehavior === 'hide') {
          this.classList.add('hidden');
        } else if (this.endBehavior === 'message') {
          const contentElement = this.querySelector('.ai-announcement-bar-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          if (contentElement && this.endedMessage) {
            contentElement.innerHTML = '<div class="ai-announcement-bar-ended-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">' + this.endedMessage + '</div>';
          }
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('announcement-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}', AnnouncementBar{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sticky announcement bar",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Conteúdo"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "message",
      "label": "Mensagem",
      "default": "Últimos dias de Le Marché – até 70% de desconto"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Countdown"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "end_date",
      "label": "Data final",
      "info": "Formato: AAAA-MM-DD (ex: 2025-12-31)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "end_time",
      "label": "Hora final",
      "info": "Formato: HH:MM:SS (ex: 23:59:59)"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "end_behavior",
      "label": "Comportamento ao terminar",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "hide",
          "label": "Ocultar barra"
        },
        {
          "value": "message",
          "label": "Mostrar mensagem"
        }
      ],
      "default": "message"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ended_message",
      "label": "Mensagem ao terminar",
      "default": "Le Marché terminou"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Call to action"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_text",
      "label": "Texto do botão"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_link",
      "label": "Link do botão"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "cta_bg_color",
      "label": "Cor de fundo do botão",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "cta_text_color",
      "label": "Cor do texto do botão",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Estilo"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Cor de fundo",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Cor do texto",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "font_family",
      "label": "Fonte",
      "default": "assistant_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "message_font_size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Tamanho da fonte da mensagem",
      "default": 14
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "timer_font_size",
      "min": 16,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Tamanho da fonte do timer",
      "default": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_vertical",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Espaçamento vertical",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_alignment",
      "label": "Alinhamento do conteúdo",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "flex-start",
          "label": "Esquerda"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Centro"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Opções"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_close_button",
      "label": "Mostrar botão fechar",
      "default": true,
      "info": "O fechamento é lembrado apenas durante a sessão"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Sticky announcement bar"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
